    slug: "barclays-import-to-xero",
    title: "How to Import Barclays Bank Statement into Xero in 2026",
    excerpt: "Learn how to import a Barclays bank statement into Xero step by step: download the PDF from Barclays, convert it to CSV, and upload it to Xero without errors.",
    featureImage: "/blog/barclays-import-to-xero.jpg",
