    slug: "credit-suisse-import-to-xero",
    title: "Import Credit Suisse Statement PDF to Xero Fast & Accurately",
    excerpt:
      "Import legacy Credit Suisse PDFs to Xero: convert statements to clean CSV and import a year of transactions with no duplicates — even across the UBS transition.",
